# Redirects (302) so any already-printed QR codes, MLS sheets, or bookmarks
# pointing at the old static per-property filenames keep working — visitors
# land on the live, Supabase-backed listing page instead of a dead link.
#
# Note: these are real redirects, not silent rewrites — a "200 rewrite" was
# tried first but doesn't work here, because it serves listing.html's raw
# file bytes without the browser ever seeing the target's "?id=..." query
# string, so the page's own JS (which reads window.location.search to know
# which property to load) never receives it. A 302 makes the browser
# actually navigate to the new URL, so the query string arrives correctly.
# The address bar changes, but the old link still lands on the right listing.
#
# Add a line here any time a new listing needs a legacy-style URL preserved.
/listing-1227-n-50-w.html                    /listing.html?id=1227-n-50-w-adbl                302
/listing-150-w-ridgeview-street-119.html     /listing.html?id=150-w-ridgeview-street-119-enb7 302
/listing-2050w.html                          /listing.html?id=2050w                           302
/listing-5225w.html                          /listing.html?id=5225w                           302
/listing-5300w.html                          /listing.html?id=5300w                           302
/listing-mountainview.html                   /listing.html?id=mountainview                    302
/listing-sodanerd.html                       /listing.html?id=sodanerd                        302
/listing-steamengine.html                    /listing.html?id=steamengine                     302
/listing-tumbleweed.html                     /listing.html?id=tumbleweed                      302

# Clean URL for the personal marketing page. A 200 rewrite (not a redirect)
# is fine here, unlike the listing rewrites above — scott.html has no query
# string it needs to read, it just fetches everything from Supabase, so
# there's nothing for a rewrite to silently drop.
/scott                                        /scott.html                                      200
